 R←Test_SendEmail_06(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;text;parts
⍝ Send an email with two attachments without mime type, and a body with a line break of its own
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewMail'Subject from APL Team SMTP: ',⊃⎕SI
 parms.Body←'Simple text',(⎕UCS 13 10),'Second line'
 parms.AddAttachment'./Test-Files/APL-Code.pdf'
 parms.AddAttachment'./Test-Files/CrashReport.html'
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 parts←∆MimeParts ∆Unstuff text
 →T.PassesIf 3=≢parts
 →T.PassesIf∨/'Simple text' 'Second line'⍷1⊃parts
 →T.PassesIf'Content-Type: application/pdf;'≡30↑⊃2⊃parts
 →T.PassesIf'Content-Type: text/html;'≡24↑⊃3⊃parts

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
